# Pinned SHA-256 of every file the host and image pipelines download.
# A download whose hash is not listed here, or does not match, is refused:
# changing a version is a reviewed change to this file, never a side effect of
# what a server returns that day. Checked by scripts/lib/pinned.sh.
#
# Format: <sha256>  <source>/<arch>/<file name>
#
# How each entry was established (redo it when adding a version):
#   alpine      — the release's detached GPG signature (.asc), verified with
#                 Alpine's release key ncopa.asc from alpinelinux.org/keys,
#                 fingerprint 0482 D840 22F5 2DF1 C4E7 CD43 293A CD09 07D9 495A.
#   kernel      — Firecracker CI publishes no checksum or signature: trust on
#                 first use. x86_64 matched the kernel this project's first
#                 host downloaded at install time; the S3 object is unchanged
#                 since 2024-11-05.
#   firecracker — the release's .sha256.txt on GitHub; the x86_64 binaries
#                 match the ones validated on the project's hardware.
# Established 2026-09-28.

